    {
      "area": "purposeful roof architecture",
      "result": "substantive improvement over 7036",
      "observation": "The repetitive floating cover grid is replaced by an open recessed work area with separate hood/vent, finned assemblies, hatch/reel details, coaming and folded arm. Major assemblies have different shapes and levels."
